@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@parcelId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@countyId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Core overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/overview

### Core evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/evidence

### Core timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/timeline

### Trace
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trace/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}

### Trace verify
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trace/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/verify

### Policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/policy/{{countyId}}

### Policy resolve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/policy/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countyId": "{{countyId}}",
  "evaluationDate": "2026-03-15"
}

### Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/analytics/{{countyId}}/summary
